  "description": "Proposed Development Description\n\nThe proposed works comprise the alteration and extension of the existing side addition to the property.\n\nAn existing side extension with a lightweight plastic roof will be upgraded and improved, including the replacement of the existing roof covering with a glazed (glass) roof structure to enhance natural light and overall appearance.\n\nThe external façade of the existing extension, which is currently in poor and deteriorated condition, will be removed and replaced with a new brick finish to match or complement the main dwelling, thereby improving durability and visual appearance.\n\nOpenings to the existing external walls will be reconfigured as follows:\n\nThe existing external door will be replaced with new French doors.\nA new sidelight window will be formed in place of an existing door.\nAn existing window opening will be modified to form a new door opening.\n\nThe existing garage door on the front elevation will be removed and infilled with brickwork, with a new window formed in its place. The garage will be converted into a utility room, potentially incorporating a shower and bathroom. The current garage is not fit for purpose, and the existing door on the façade is outdated and does not provide adequate security.\n\nThe proposal also includes the removal of an existing unusable external toilet structure, which is in poor condition and no longer fit for purpose. This is located the rear of property. \n\nIn addition, the proposal includes the removal of the existing chimney stack, which does not serve any internal chimney breast and will be taken down with appropriate making good to the roof and external finishes.",
